Package: qore-tar-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-tar-module-doc
Description: archive modules and command-line tool for Qore
 This package provides the native tar archive module, TarDataProvider and
 the qtar command-line tool. It includes source and compiled Qore modules,
 compiler metadata, provider resources and translations. Archive compression
 uses libarchive and encryption support uses OpenSSL.

Package: qore-tar-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-tar-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's archive modules
 This package contains HTML API references and example tests for the tar
 native module, TarDataProvider and qtar.
